  <item>
    <title>Vol.005 不常规的断舍离探讨！两个极端人士和你聊聊：多一点牵绊，也多一点自由</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669ba0938fcadceb90adc1c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669ba0938fcadceb90adc1c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 11:33:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>和花不花冤枉钱无关，也没什么收纳干货。</span></p><span></span><p><span>会有口癖和不标准的普通话，正是这些随意和随机，才有了节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><p><span>大概会探讨一些：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>回忆断舍离：那些代表我们成长的物件</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>衣服断舍离：越是丑衣服，穿得越多；以及永远只能有六条牛仔裤的强迫践行者</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>CD 和磁带的永恒，忘不掉的何止是旋律</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>不断舍离的人，总得在厨房断舍离：亦包含绿豆汤是红色还是绿色的以及皮蛋到底该怎么吃</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>为了做手工组装，装完了就闲置：这里确实有个小福利（欢迎留言）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>喔，别忘了新时代的「数据断舍离」</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎁 也很好奇：家里着火的时候，在确保你生命安全的情况下，你还能带走一件东西，那会是什么？（留言或许会有小惊喜）</span></p><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuG8J7wU0lRTt1Z5TygWrkuYBZ1q.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Cartier Tank 👆</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo75m5VvAl87tf1JJHdJV8pqcKij.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>HERMES Cape Cod So Black</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpANbC1BRO736PHvByFQvYDb9lq-.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>CHANEL J12 w. Original Diamond</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq_BuCOErXtiX3PQ5zy6cgQXCKhI.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>很纯粹的 Clear Tech 透明磁带机</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiCIl7u9R6sjGgQiv89jL9Ohs-8o.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Nintendo Labo</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lolWGLNcJLrDdO6foPfcODo4kOdN.m4a" length="50540678" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpJHJUDSU2j9D3B3o-BROHu1exYg.png"/>
